   "description": "🚀 Join the Agentic Academy: https://skool.com/scrapes\n👀 Be the brand AI recommends: https://dub.sh/rankspot-yt\nDon't miss the next build - https://www.youtube.com/@simonscrapes?sub_confirmation=1\n\nAnthropic just shipped a huge update to Claude: Projects. It's an early look at a true agentic operating system built right into the platform. In this video, I break down what's new, including the long-running orchestrator conversations, how threads inherit context and memory, the built-in RAG for massive knowledge bases, and the future of team permissions. We'll also explore what this means for the future of custom-built Agentic Operating Systems.\n\n#claudecode #claudecodetutorial #agenticos",
